# Instruction metadata

- Edit declarative metadata only; regenerate tables/code. Never hand-patch generated outputs.
- New opcodes need: mnemonic, opcode map, operands, flags written/read, modes, feature gate, semantic key.
- Feature gates must match CPU profiles; do not enable SSE4.2/AVX/etc. until implemented and tested.
- Decoder must reject truncated and overlong encodings with tests.
- After metadata changes, run decoder tests and XED oracle comparison when available.
